OL,3,ATwo men re-arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Aassisting Iran intelligence after RAF
OL,5,AFairford incident
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice had been alerted to three
OL,8,Fsuspicious vehicles near the US airbase
OL,9,Fin Gloucestershire in the early hours
OL,10,Fof 27 September - a major incident was
OL,11,Fsubsequently declared and dozens of
OL,12,Fhomes evacuated.
OL,14,FSeven men in total have been arrested
OL,15,Fas part of the counter-terror police
OL,16,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
