OL,3,AMan charged with attack on Australia MP
OL,4,Ato face court
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal media earlier named the alleged
OL,7,Fattacker as environmental activist
OL,8,FBrendan Nugent. His father and his
OL,9,Fpartner said they had been friends with
OL,10,FHaines "for more than 20 years" and
OL,11,Fthanked residents and officers who
OL,12,Fhelped her after the "shocking and
OL,13,Fhorrific crime".
OL,15,FHaines remains in a critical condition
OL,16,Fafter surgery and is reported to have
OL,17,Flost one of her legs.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
